import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 847 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Civilizational Aesthetics","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 847 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Civilizational Aesthetics","no":847,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Civilizational Aesthetics","Aesthetic Standard","Anti-Predation Aesthetics","Myriad-Rank Aesthetics"],"related":["26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","846-Transcended-One Artistic Creation Overview","862-Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.md","filePath":"en/0847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.md"}`),s={name:"en/0847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.md"};function o(r,e,l,d,h,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-847-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-civilizational-aesthetics" tabindex="-1">Entry 847 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Aesthetics <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-847-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-civilizational-aesthetics" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 847 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Aesthetics&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 26, 846, 862</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-what-a-civilization-considers-beautiful-exposes-what-it-believes" tabindex="-1">Introduction: what a civilization considers beautiful exposes what it believes <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-what-a-civilization-considers-beautiful-exposes-what-it-believes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: what a civilization considers beautiful exposes what it believes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Aesthetics is no small matter. What a civilization praises as &quot;beautiful&quot; equals what it hints to Myriad Ranks is &quot;worth pursuing.&quot; The old worldview&#39;s aesthetics is essentially predatory aesthetics: the strong consider fragmentation beautiful, violence beautiful, crushing beautiful — &quot;treading all prodigies&quot; of the Battle Through the Heavens style is written as the most heroic scene. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to establish is another set of aesthetics: <strong>symbiosis beauty, co-building beauty, Myriad-Rank-republican beauty.</strong> This entry explains how the transcended one establishes for the whole civilization a civilizational aesthetics isomorphic with the five axioms.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong>: aesthetics itself is anti-predation&#39;s battlefield — what is praised shapes the next generation&#39;s heart-nature; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires aesthetics not favor some clan; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires beauty point to common uplift; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires aesthetic guidance not manipulate; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires aesthetic standards align with fundamental laws, not changed by plot needs.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-is-civilizational-aesthetics" tabindex="-1">I. What Is &quot;Civilizational Aesthetics&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-civilizational-aesthetics" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is &quot;Civilizational Aesthetics&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational aesthetics is not &quot;how to draw a beautiful picture,&quot; but <strong>the whole civilization&#39;s collective answer to &quot;what is worth praising.&quot;</strong> It manifests in:</p><ul><li>What hangs and is displayed in public spaces — is it the strong one&#39;s statue, or Myriad Ranks&#39; co-built group portrait;</li><li>Whom do anniversaries commemorate — is it the hegemon who opened territory, or the contributor who fed back Myriad Ranks;</li><li>What words does language use to praise — &quot;peerless,&quot; &quot;sole-venerable,&quot; or &quot;co-built,&quot; &quot;republican&quot;;</li><li>Whom do young people aspire to become — is it the autocratic heavenly emperor, or the competent transcended one.</li></ul><p>The transcended one&#39;s civilizational aesthetics is systematically twisting these &quot;hidden praise directions&quot; onto the axioms.</p><h2 id="ii-anti-predation-aesthetics-three-old-aesthetics-to-uproot" tabindex="-1">II. Anti-Predation Aesthetics: Three Old Aesthetics to Uproot <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-anti-predation-aesthetics-three-old-aesthetics-to-uproot" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Anti-Predation Aesthetics: Three Old Aesthetics to Uproot&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilizational aesthetics is first &quot;decontamination&quot; — uprooting three old-world predatory aesthetics:</p><ol><li><strong>Crushing beauty</strong>: considering &quot;one person alone pressing down Myriad Ranks&quot; as grandeur. Rewrite as — considering &quot;lifting Myriad Ranks forward together&quot; as grandeur.</li><li><strong>Fragmentation beauty</strong>: considering &quot;seeking defeat alone,&quot; &quot;sole decision over eons&quot; as sublime. Rewrite as — considering &quot;symbiosis with Myriad Ranks&quot; as sublime.</li><li><strong>Possession beauty</strong>: considering &quot;holding heaven and earth,&quot; &quot;collecting all things&quot; as wealth. Rewrite as — considering &quot;all things shared, increment development&quot; as abundance.</li></ol><p>Each aesthetic replacement is a heart-nature reprogramming.</p><h2 id="iii-symbiosis-aesthetics-four-positive-standards" tabindex="-1">III. Symbiosis Aesthetics&#39; Four Positive Standards <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-symbiosis-aesthetics-four-positive-standards" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Symbiosis Aesthetics&#39; Four Positive Standards&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After decontamination, the transcended one establishes symbiosis aesthetics&#39; four positive standards:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Standard</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Corresponding Axiom</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Harmony</td><td>Harmony between individual and collective, Myriad Ranks and laws</td><td>Myriad-Rank republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Growth</td><td>Life continuously uplifting, civilization perpetually iterating dynamic beauty</td><td>Collective uplift</td></tr><tr><td>Transparency</td><td>Laws, power, knowledge publicly queryable clear beauty</td><td>Anti-predation</td></tr><tr><td>Diversity</td><td>Myriad-Rank clans&#39; life forms each beautiful richness</td><td>Myriad-Rank republicanism</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These four standards are not rigid rules, but &quot;aesthetic North Star&quot; — concrete works may vary a thousand ways, but all head in this direction.</p><h2 id="iv-aesthetic-guidance-not-aesthetic-autocracy" tabindex="-1">IV. Aesthetic Guidance, Not Aesthetic Autocracy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-aesthetic-guidance-not-aesthetic-autocracy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Aesthetic Guidance, Not Aesthetic Autocracy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one establishing aesthetic standards absolutely does not equal &quot;stipulating what Myriad Ranks must like.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s discipline:</p><ul><li>Aesthetic standards are &quot;exemplary,&quot; not &quot;prohibitive&quot; — do not forbid Myriad Ranks from being beautiful per their clan traditions;</li><li>Each civilizational typology (East-Asian intensive, Nordic welfare, North-American pluralism, etc.) retains its own aesthetic character;</li><li>The transcended one&#39;s duty is to make the highest-level symbiosis-aesthetics works, letting Myriad Ranks &quot;have seen the good,&quot; naturally moving upward.</li></ul><p>This is entry 862 &quot;cultural diversity&quot; at the aesthetic level — <strong>diversity is the base, symbiosis is the direction.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: condense the transcended one&#39;s deep understanding of laws and civilization into aesthetic standards, continuously nourishing Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: uproot crushing, fragmentation, possession three predatory aesthetics, cutting predatory-heart hotbed from the aesthetic root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system extols sole-venerable, crushing beauty; Heng Yuan Zhou establishes harmony, growth, transparency, diversity symbiosis beauty</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: aesthetic standards consider five lineages and five civilizational typologies, not favoring one clan&#39;s aesthetics</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: aesthetic standards, representative works, evaluation mechanism all open network-wide, accepting Myriad Ranks&#39; joint judgment</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-aesthetic-guidance-s-boundary-and-supervision" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Aesthetic Guidance&#39;s Boundary and Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-aesthetic-guidance-s-boundary-and-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Aesthetic Guidance&#39;s Boundary and Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one establishing civilizational aesthetics is &quot;guidance&quot; not &quot;stipulation&quot;; this boundary itself is institutionally guarded. Myriad-Rank clans retain the right to aestheticize per their own traditions; the transcended one may not, under &quot;promoting symbiosis aesthetics&quot; name, suppress diversity. His work is to make the highest-level symbiosis-aesthetics works, letting Myriad Ranks &quot;have seen the good,&quot; naturally moving upward. Aesthetic guidance&#39;s effect — Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature purification, predatory rhetoric receding — converts into the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight. The whole process proceeds under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, ensuring guidance does not become imposition. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s aesthetics is both upward and free, Myriad Ranks in daily heard-seen will naturally stay away from predation and draw near to symbiosis.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>What a civilization considers beautiful cultivates what kind of next generation. The transcended one&#39;s civilizational aesthetics takes the softest battlefield of &quot;beauty&quot; back from predation — no longer praising sole-veneration, but praising co-building; no longer worshipping crushing, but worshipping symbiosis. When Myriad Ranks in daily seen, heard, sung, day after day nourished by harmony, growth, transparency, diversity beauty, anti-predation is no longer only legal text, but everyone&#39;s intuition. This is civilizational aesthetics&#39; deepest power.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/846_模块4-超脱者与艺术-总论.html">Entry 846 · Transcended-One Artistic Creation Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.html">Entry 862 · Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
